WEBVTT

00:01:29.544 --> 00:01:32.046
And make it a place
that people love and trust.

00:01:32.588 --> 00:01:35.967
And so one of the
things about it, of course,

00:01:35.967 --> 00:01:39.220
is that it is edited entirely
by volunteers,

00:01:39.262 --> 00:01:42.431
ordinary people from all over the world.

00:01:42.473 --> 00:01:45.226
All of the decisions
about encyclopedic content

00:01:45.226 --> 00:01:47.103
and organizational policies

00:01:47.145 --> 00:01:50.481
take place in a transparent
and open fashion.

00:01:51.524 --> 00:01:54.068
This means that Wikipedia
can continue to change

00:01:54.068 --> 00:01:55.611
as the world changes around it,

00:01:55.611 --> 00:01:58.406
integrating new ideas
and new perspectives.

00:01:58.865 --> 00:02:01.075
